{
  "id": 16,
  "timestamp": 1788626058,
  "title": {
    "en_US": "Vinput 2.3.16 — Direct commit toggle, empty prompt support & GUI i18n",
    "zh_CN": "Vinput 2.3.16 — 后处理直接上屏、允许空 Prompt 与 GUI 界面完整汉化"
  },
  "text": {
    "en_US": "1) Direct Commit via show_raw: Scenes can now configure show_raw (default true). Set --show-raw false (or uncheck in GUI) to exclude the raw transcript from candidate options. When an adapter or LLM produces a single clean result, it commits directly to the screen without popping up a candidate menu.\n\n2) Optional Scene Prompt: Scene prompts are no longer mandatory. Adapters and custom proxies with built-in rules can leave prompt empty without requiring a dummy placeholder.\n\n3) Complete GUI Localization: Standard dialog buttons (OK/Cancel) and previously untranslated dialog fields now follow the system language seamlessly.",
    "zh_CN": "1）单结果直接上屏（show_raw）：后处理场景新增 show_raw 配置项（默认开启）。在场景中传入 --show-raw false（或在 GUI 中取消勾选）可在候选列表中排除原始语音转写文本；当适配器或 LLM 仅输出单一结果时直接上屏，不再弹出候选词菜单，完美配合清洗类适配器。\n\n2）场景 Prompt 允许留空：后处理场景定义不再强制要求填写提示词。内置处理规则的适配器或自定义代理可直接将 prompt 留空，告别无意义的占位符。\n\n3）GUI 界面完整汉化：全面解决适配器对话框等界面的英文混杂问题，标准对话框按钮（确定/取消）现已完美跟随系统语言。"
  },
  "url": "https://github.com/xifan2333/fcitx5-vinput/releases/tag/v2.3.16"
}

